OL,3,GNEWSATenants group may also face
OL,4,Acharges over Grenfell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tenants' association could face a
OL,7,Fcorporate manslaughter charge over the
OL,8,F2017 Grenfell Tower fire in west
OL,9,FLondon, it has been revealed.
OL,11,FFollowing a nine-year investigation
OL,12,Finto the disaster, the Metropolitan
OL,13,FPolice this week handed files on 20
OL,14,Forganisations and 54 individuals to the
OL,15,FCrown Prosecution Service (CPS).
OL,17,FAmong those is Kensington and Chelsea
OL,18,FTenant Management Organisation (KCTMO)
OL,19,F- which was in charge of the local
OL,20,Fcouncil's social housing stock - could
OL,21,Falso face health and safety and
OL,22,Fregulatory charges.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
